        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): mark connected status degraded without bot identity",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhen Slack auth.test fails at boot, or channels.slack.botToken is actually a user token (xoxp without bot_id), Socket Mode can still connect and previously published healthState: \"healthy\". Operators see a connected channel while mention detection is disabled and required-mention rooms fail closed — silent inbound loss.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nTransport liveness (connected: true) is still useful, but advertising healthy is wrong when bot identity is missing. The fix adds a degraded option to publishSlackConnectedStatus that sets healthState: degraded with the identity error.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Channels with missing bot identity show \"degraded\" instead of \"healthy\"\n- Operators can distinguish transport-up from fully operational\n- App Home and resolution formatting are unchanged (regressions from earlier branch removed)\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Real Slack API — Valid Bot Token\n\n```\n$ curl -s https://slack.com/api/auth.test\n{\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"bot_id\": \"B0BGACNKEGJ\",\n    \"team_id\": \"T0BG72E2G2Z\",\n    \"user_id\": \"U0BFV1X131V\"\n}\n```\n\n### Healthy (bot_id present) vs Degraded (missing identity)\n\n```\nHealthy:  { \"connected\": true, \"healthState\": \"healthy\",  \"lastError\": null }\nDegraded: { \"connected\": true, \"healthState\": \"degraded\", \"lastError\": \"auth.test returned no user_id\" }\n```\n\n### Unit Tests (49/49 passed)\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.reconnect.test.ts\n ✓ marks socket mode degraded when boot identity is unavailable\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  18 passed (18)\n\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.auth-test-token.test.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  7 passed (7)\n\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.auth-errors.test.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  24 passed (24)\n```\n\n### Lint + Format\n\n```\n$ npx oxlint -c .oxlintrc.json extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.ts   # No errors\n$ npx oxfmt --check extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider-support.ts       # Correct format\n```\n\n## What Changed\n\n- extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider-support.ts: +14/-0 (degraded option)\n- extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.ts: +13/-2 (identityDegraded detection)\n- extensions/slack/src/monitor/provider.reconnect.test.ts: +18/-0 (test)\n\nFixes #105556\n\n## AI Assistance 🤖\n- **AI-assisted**: Yes\n- **Co-Authored-By**: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n- **Human confirmed understanding**: Yes",
